[cell][b]众落规模[/b][/cell]
[cell][b]大致区域[/b][/cell]
[cell]辽西乌桓[/cell]
[cell][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "丘力居", "cat": "people"}]丘力居[/url][/color]→[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "蹋顿", "cat": "people"}]蹋顿[/url][/color][/cell]
[cell]五千余落[/cell]
[cell]今辽宁义县、朝阳一带[/cell]
[cell]上谷乌桓[/cell]
[cell]难楼[/cell]
[cell]九千余落[/cell]
[cell]今河北怀来、张家口一带[/cell]
[cell]辽东属国乌桓[/cell]
[cell]苏仆延（峭王）[/cell]
[cell]千余落[/cell]
[cell]今辽宁辽阳一带[/cell]
[cell]右北平乌桓[/cell]
